@startuml
title Fabric Render Commit (High-level Sequence)

skinparam monochrome true

actor Dev as Developer
participant "React (JS)" as JS
participant "JSI (C++)" as JSI
participant "Fabric Renderer" as Fabric
participant "ShadowTree" as Shadow
participant "Yoga" as Yoga
participant "UIManager (Fabric)" as UIM
participant "Platform UI Thread" as UIThread
participant "Native View" as NativeView

Dev -> JS : setState()/render()
JS -> JSI : commit()
JSI -> Fabric : build mutations
Fabric -> Shadow : create/update shadow nodes
Shadow -> Yoga : layout()
Yoga --> Fabric : layout results
Fabric -> UIM : schedule/mount mutations
UIM -> UIThread : apply updates
UIThread -> NativeView : create/update UIView / android.view.View
@enduml
